      {
        "text": "P7's odd-station sensors change together through one shared pressure-conversion connection, while intervening stations do not show a comparable drop. The revised calibration record describes a test beginning at 90 seconds elapsed that may introduce approximately the observed offset. P3-ST2-A's disagreement with its paired sensor and P2-ST2-A's large adjacent-reading jump provide separate reasons to check measurement quality. KN-QUALITY-R1 and KN-INDEPENDENCE-R1 caution that association and unusual readings do not prove hardware failure. Review calibration results, connection assignments and independent pressure references; this explanation does not by itself account for P5's pattern across both connections.",
